# Omni - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_omni.kbd)
**omni + spc**      -- Command Palette
**omni + a**        -- Select All
**omni + lsft + a** -- Invert Selection
**omni + rsft + a** -- Clear Selection
**omni + b**        -- Page Up
**omni + c**        -- Copy
**omni + d**        -- Duplicate
**omni + f**        -- Page Down
**omni + g**        -- Seek And Select
**omni + n**        -- New
**omni + lsft + n** -- New Folder
**omni + rsft + n** -- Save
**omni + o**        -- Open
**omni + p**        -- Parent
**omni + r**        -- Rename
**omni + v**        -- Paste
**omni + x**        -- Cut
**omni + ]**        -- Forward
**omni + [**        -- Back
